    "agendaChanges": "Section 10 item 10.1 (Discussion of Districtwide Solar Phase 2 Financial Study) was pulled and deferred to a future meeting. Section 9 item 9.3 (Approval of Proposal for Infrastructure of Two Video/Intercom Buzzers with Atlas Pellizzari for Hawes School) was pulled from the Bond Program Consent Items bundle and moved to individual action. Section 11 (School/Community Reports) was taken up before Sections 9 and 10 in the regular session order of business — actually Section 9 consent bundle (minus 9.3) was approved first, then 9.3 as individual action, then Section 11. A late online public speaker (Deanne Dell'Antoni) submitted a card during the dyslexia study session but ultimately did not speak when called upon after the school reports.",
